 ALARM RESET / POWER / TRAY END, main.cpp:2379-2656) and its TimerScanKeyTimer
 guards (:31994-32025) ported in WebMainScanKey.cpp, ticked every wb_serve
 main-loop pass (and the drag keepalive); TfHome::ScanKey (panel PAUSE aborts
 Home, uhome.cpp:4874-4889) with Timer1->Enabled un-gated in uhome.cpp;
